WEBVTT

00:00:00.206 --> 00:00:06.681
At the end of the
difficult journey.

00:00:07.466 --> 00:00:11.354
Mr. Garcia rescued Candy
from attacking bandits.

00:00:11.804 --> 00:00:18.304
However, a man in the automobile
caught up to them and took Candy away.

00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:22.534
Just where is Candy being taken to?

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:37.056
This is... a hotel?

00:00:37.882 --> 00:00:39.964
You did good, Sam.

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:42.003
Thank you, mr. George.

00:00:42.598 --> 00:00:47.686
I'll be departing immediately.
I'm leaving the rest to you.

00:00:47.721 --> 00:00:49.050
As you wish.

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:52.182
That man must be the
kidnapper's boss!

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:53.675
If I don't run now...

00:00:54.684 --> 00:00:56.565
Kurin, now's our chance.

00:01:00.441 --> 00:01:02.089
Huh? Wait!

00:01:02.319 --> 00:01:05.055
Wait! Hey, wait up!

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:06.805
Wait!

00:01:11.651 --> 00:01:13.107
Help me, Kurin!

00:01:13.891 --> 00:01:15.441
Put me down!

00:01:15.854 --> 00:01:17.179
Put me down!

00:01:18.694 --> 00:01:22.384
Somebody help me!
Kurin!

00:01:23.366 --> 00:01:24.797
Do something!

00:01:25.769 --> 00:01:27.277
Let me go!

00:01:28.973 --> 00:01:31.060
Put me down!

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:36.180
Put me down!

00:01:42.616 --> 00:01:45.246
She's kind of strange.

00:01:47.224 --> 00:01:50.680
That's not true! I was
kidnapped!

00:01:50.698 --> 00:01:52.390
Help me!

00:01:55.638 --> 00:01:56.984
She's coming!

00:01:57.616 --> 00:02:00.544
What... what are you doing?

00:02:02.406 --> 00:02:03.680
I'll leave her to you.

00:02:03.828 --> 00:02:04.579
Yes.

00:02:07.468 --> 00:02:09.052
Now, please.

00:02:09.591 --> 00:02:10.569
What?

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.765
Just who are you?

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:28.309
Wha... what are you doing!

00:02:31.386 --> 00:02:32.370
Kurin!

00:02:37.273 --> 00:02:39.464
I want to be alone in the bathroom!

00:02:40.013 --> 00:02:44.945
We'll make you look extra
pretty for mr. George.

00:02:45.739 --> 00:02:49.272
George! That's the man
I saw before!

00:02:53.084 --> 00:02:56.066
Just who is this George?

00:02:56.583 --> 00:03:01.248
Dunno. We are his employees us but we
don't really know him all that well.

00:03:01.923 --> 00:03:03.121
Will you let me escape then?

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:05.022
Huh? Escape?

00:03:05.822 --> 00:03:07.528
I was kidnapped!

00:03:07.938 --> 00:03:10.402
Kidnapped? You?

00:03:13.268 --> 00:03:14.314
It's true!

00:03:14.668 --> 00:03:17.314
That man named Sam is the
one who kidnapped me!

00:03:18.038 --> 00:03:25.617
Oh well. Why would a kidnapper want
to give you such a wonderful dress?

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:26.719
It's...

00:03:29.343 --> 00:03:30.822
It's for me?

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:31.999
Yeah.

00:03:32.839 --> 00:03:34.970
What is the meaning of this?

00:03:40.167 --> 00:03:42.889
So beautiful!
It looks good on you.

00:03:44.864 --> 00:03:47.258
Really!
It suits me perfectly.

00:03:47.293 --> 00:03:51.217
It looks good on me. But why was
I given such a wonderful dress...?

00:03:53.183 --> 00:03:54.145
It's pretty.

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:57.305
I'm sure mr. George will be pleased.

00:03:57.856 --> 00:04:02.327
George... you don't know much
about him, right?

00:04:02.531 --> 00:04:05.697
Yeah. But I know that he's a
good gentleman from London.

00:04:06.798 --> 00:04:08.138
From London?

00:04:09.778 --> 00:04:13.023
Perpetrators are using an automobile
to kidnap children...

00:04:13.058 --> 00:04:17.255
...who are then sold off to Europe.
Be careful!

00:04:18.254 --> 00:04:21.250
I'm sure the sheriff was
talking about this George guy!

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:24.503
But... his gentle face was...

00:04:25.324 --> 00:04:28.475
...no! One can't judge people
by the look on their face alone!

00:04:29.043 --> 00:04:32.702
Mr. Garcia looked scary but he turned
out to be a very good person.

00:04:34.402 --> 00:04:36.770
I'm sure that these people
are trying to deceive me as well.

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:41.303
If I don't do something,
I'll be sold off to London!

00:04:52.082 --> 00:04:56.647
After all, this old dress still
suits me best.

00:04:59.235 --> 00:05:00.211
Alright now.

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:02.001
Let's go, Kurin!

00:05:05.674 --> 00:05:06.890
It's okay!

00:05:23.253 --> 00:05:25.538
Kurin, don't look down!

00:05:26.331 --> 00:05:27.627
Follow me!

00:05:49.783 --> 00:05:52.119
Kurin, I'm okay!
Hurry up now!

00:06:34.625 --> 00:06:37.676
Well, Candy? Will you promise
that you won't try to flee again?

00:06:38.552 --> 00:06:41.638
I had no option but to lock
you up in here.

00:06:43.749 --> 00:06:48.046
Can't help it. I'll have to keep you
in here until you depart tommorrow.

00:06:48.953 --> 00:06:51.336
Depart tommorrow?
Where to?

00:06:51.371 --> 00:06:53.679
First I want you to promise me that
you won't try to flee again!

00:06:54.953 --> 00:06:56.522
I'm not sure about that!

00:06:56.653 --> 00:07:02.320
I was ordered by mr. George to bring
you to him. Don't hate me for that.

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:09.095
It looks like I'll be taken
to London, after all.

00:07:10.949 --> 00:07:15.976
Anthony... You're still thinking
that I've gone to Mexico, right?

00:07:17.259 --> 00:07:20.105
But I don't want to go to London.

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:28.268
Yeah, I have you, Kurin.
I won't give up!

00:07:41.158 --> 00:07:45.477
Anthony, what's the matter?
Can't you dance more cheerfully?

00:07:46.474 --> 00:07:47.877
I don't want to dance.

00:07:48.183 --> 00:07:54.272
You must. Aunt Elroy did this
party for me, am I right?

00:07:56.237 --> 00:07:57.660
I'm just not in the mood for this.

00:07:58.546 --> 00:08:01.146
I'm sure he's thinking about Candy!

00:08:02.339 --> 00:08:05.697
Ever since Candy left, he has
become cold to me again.

00:08:07.211 --> 00:08:09.125
-No!
-Eliza?

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:11.487
No, no! We have to dance!

00:08:12.776 --> 00:08:15.510
-Oh, boy.
-Poor Anthony!

00:08:18.369 --> 00:08:19.321
What's the matter?

00:08:21.304 --> 00:08:22.191
Garcia!

00:08:22.279 --> 00:08:25.177
Madam, I'm very sorry!

00:08:25.651 --> 00:08:27.955
What happened?

00:08:28.482 --> 00:08:32.121
Candy was... Candy was kidnapped!

00:08:32.854 --> 00:08:34.115
Candy...!?

00:08:35.175 --> 00:08:36.882
Calm down, everyone.

00:08:40.558 --> 00:08:45.404
Tell us everything in the back room.
Everyone, please continue the party!

00:08:49.862 --> 00:08:54.432
I haven't noticed that they were
following us day and night!

00:08:54.645 --> 00:08:57.092
How could you allow this to happen?

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:59.313
I'm so sorry!

00:08:59.348 --> 00:09:03.457
When we were around Yellow Rock, suddenly...

00:09:04.096 --> 00:09:07.103
Immediately inform Pony's home
about this incident!

00:09:07.326 --> 00:09:09.149
This is of utmost importance.

00:09:10.153 --> 00:09:14.502
Do everything you can to take Candy
away from hands of those kidnappers!

00:09:14.729 --> 00:09:15.533
Yes!

00:09:16.813 --> 00:09:20.504
Stear, Archie! Let's rescue
Candy ourselves!

00:09:20.728 --> 00:09:23.924
-That's right, Anthony!
-It was in Yellow Rock, right?

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:25.218
Alright, let's go!

00:09:25.602 --> 00:09:29.339
Wait!
Anthony! Stear! Archie!

00:09:29.463 --> 00:09:30.786
Anthony!

00:09:35.406 --> 00:09:39.263
Candy... We'll save you...
we'll save you for sure!

00:09:40.112 --> 00:09:41.404
Hang in there.

00:09:48.262 --> 00:09:50.800
-I called the car for you.
-Thanks.

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:52.538
Thank you for your work.

00:09:54.356 --> 00:09:59.693
Send my regards to mr. George.
Miss, take care.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.581
Everyone is being deceived
by this George guy.

00:10:03.941 --> 00:10:05.446
Give this to sheriff!

00:10:05.858 --> 00:10:06.767
Sheriff?

00:10:08.211 --> 00:10:10.076
Please!

00:10:12.483 --> 00:10:16.474
"I was kidnapped, please send help.
-Candy."

00:10:16.856 --> 00:10:18.016
Just what is this?

00:10:18.615 --> 00:10:21.371
Maybe she's a bit fuzzy in here?

00:10:22.052 --> 00:10:24.337
They all go crazy once they
hit puberty!

00:10:27.004 --> 00:10:29.871
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Watch out for deus ex machina!

00:10:38.482 --> 00:10:40.647
Why do you keep looking behind?

00:10:41.317 --> 00:10:42.828
It's nothing...

00:10:43.633 --> 00:10:46.368
It seems that sheriff won't be
coming to help me.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:56.287
Brother, are you sure
we're going the right way?

00:10:56.322 --> 00:10:57.404
Don't say that!

00:10:57.929 --> 00:11:00.342
Stear, can't you go any faster?

00:11:00.357 --> 00:11:02.719
I can do that, but the
car will come apart!

00:11:03.519 --> 00:11:05.288
If we don't get there soon, Candy will...

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:10.167
Hey there, mr. Impatient, we don't
even know where Candy is yet.

00:11:10.588 --> 00:11:14.530
Candy was kidnapped near Yellow Rock!
She couldn't have gotten far!

00:11:15.915 --> 00:11:18.790
Brother, understand Anthony's feelings!

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:21.981
Alright, I'll step on it!

00:12:12.676 --> 00:12:16.496
Why are you giving me treats and
letting me bathe every day?

00:12:16.731 --> 00:12:20.162
I want you to look a little bit
more pretty and elegant.

00:12:20.381 --> 00:12:22.251
That was George's idea, too?

00:12:22.838 --> 00:12:27.842
That's right. When I bring you home,
I want you to look like a real lady.

00:12:28.426 --> 00:12:33.379
I knew it! They want me to look elegant
so I could be sold at a higher price!

00:12:33.935 --> 00:12:35.133
I won't let you do that!

00:12:35.368 --> 00:12:37.089
Stop the car!

00:12:37.193 --> 00:12:38.188
What's the matter?

00:12:40.542 --> 00:12:43.028
Hey... Candy!

00:12:45.523 --> 00:12:48.665
If I do this, nobody will want me!

00:12:51.435 --> 00:12:53.958
I'll have you washed as soon
as we return!

00:12:53.993 --> 00:12:55.866
But you won't be able to wash the dress!

00:12:56.579 --> 00:12:58.547
You've got plenty of clothes
to change into!

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:02.549
This.. This too!

00:13:12.767 --> 00:13:14.062
This is Mississippi.

00:13:17.328 --> 00:13:18.540
A ship!

00:13:18.711 --> 00:13:22.845
They descend down the river and
go across the ocean to Europe.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:24.576
To Europe?

00:13:25.371 --> 00:13:29.897
London! That means...
I'm supposed to board this ship?

00:13:31.017 --> 00:13:32.860
No!
I don't want to go!

00:13:35.499 --> 00:13:36.725
Candy!

00:13:47.283 --> 00:13:48.199
Candy!

00:14:06.112 --> 00:14:07.463
Damn it.

00:14:13.030 --> 00:14:14.882
It seems that he hasn't noticed us!

00:14:16.228 --> 00:14:17.199
An automobile!

00:14:21.208 --> 00:14:24.496
A tire blew out!
Just when we were in such a hurry!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.289
Can I ask you something?

00:14:28.484 --> 00:14:29.508
What is it?

00:14:29.718 --> 00:14:32.360
Did you see a girl with a raccoon?

00:14:32.423 --> 00:14:33.803
What?

00:14:34.573 --> 00:14:36.818
That girl... was she called Candy?

00:14:37.373 --> 00:14:38.467
That's right.

00:14:38.702 --> 00:14:40.336
-That means...
-It's you!

00:14:40.947 --> 00:14:42.089
What are you doing?

00:14:42.432 --> 00:14:43.969
Where is Candy?

00:14:44.156 --> 00:14:44.889
She escaped!

00:14:45.154 --> 00:14:45.729
Escaped?

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:49.136
-Alright, let's go!
-What are you doing?

00:14:50.349 --> 00:14:52.050
We'll trade cars!

00:14:52.454 --> 00:14:53.599
But...

00:14:54.832 --> 00:14:56.625
Hey, wait!

00:15:02.665 --> 00:15:05.966
Keep going...
I already got this far.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:25.975
A station!

00:15:30.389 --> 00:15:31.568
Sam's car!

00:15:32.761 --> 00:15:35.774
If I happen to see her,
I'll report it.

00:15:35.964 --> 00:15:36.961
Please.

00:15:39.208 --> 00:15:40.553
It's time!

00:15:46.514 --> 00:15:49.273
Candy... where are you?

00:15:52.205 --> 00:15:55.559
But I'm glad that you managed
to get away from the bad guys.

00:15:58.817 --> 00:16:00.798
I wonder where is this train
going to.

00:16:01.507 --> 00:16:03.086
I don't care where it takes me.

00:16:06.856 --> 00:16:08.822
As long as it goes to America
where Anthony is, it'll be okay.

00:16:16.458 --> 00:16:17.421
We've stopped.

00:16:17.999 --> 00:16:19.353
I wonder where am I.

00:16:23.841 --> 00:16:24.913
And what are you?

00:16:24.948 --> 00:16:26.445
-Kurin!
-What are you doing there?

00:16:27.644 --> 00:16:28.897
Hey, wait!

00:16:30.322 --> 00:16:32.657
If you go into that forrest,
you'll get lost!

00:16:36.387 --> 00:16:39.226
There are Sam's accomplices
on this station, too.

00:16:39.747 --> 00:16:41.688
If they caught me this time,
I'd be done for!

00:17:02.013 --> 00:17:05.332
Where...
Just where am I?

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:08.057
I'm so tired.

00:17:11.881 --> 00:17:13.422
I can't walk anymore.

00:17:13.668 --> 00:17:15.078
Anthony!

00:17:44.395 --> 00:17:47.312
Kurin, you were watching over
me the whole time?

00:17:48.068 --> 00:17:48.982
Thank you!

00:17:54.568 --> 00:17:56.275
This smell...!

00:17:59.715 --> 00:18:00.871
The rose gates!

00:18:01.698 --> 00:18:03.063
This place is then...

00:18:04.172 --> 00:18:05.975
This is Anthony's...

00:18:13.396 --> 00:18:14.750
Anthony!

00:18:14.953 --> 00:18:15.903
Candy!

00:18:16.561 --> 00:18:17.705
Anthony!

00:18:18.057 --> 00:18:18.834
Candy!

00:18:21.175 --> 00:18:26.063
Candy!
I believed that you would make it home!

00:18:26.672 --> 00:18:28.310
But to find you in this place...

00:18:31.246 --> 00:18:34.070
-Hey, you two!
-Come with us!

00:18:34.488 --> 00:18:35.328
Where to?

00:18:35.566 --> 00:18:38.535
Of course, to talk to aunt Elroy!

00:18:39.541 --> 00:18:41.176
I am right here.

00:18:41.322 --> 00:18:42.487
Aunt!

00:18:43.105 --> 00:18:46.667
Wasn't Candy kidnapped?
So what is she doing here?

00:18:47.271 --> 00:18:49.079
Candy managed to escape.

00:18:49.518 --> 00:18:50.967
Escape?

00:18:51.273 --> 00:18:54.206
Then all of this was just
another one of your pranks?

00:18:54.585 --> 00:18:55.993
You've misunderstood us!

00:19:01.209 --> 00:19:03.569
That's grandfather William's car.

00:19:03.604 --> 00:19:05.188
Grandfather William is here?

00:19:08.676 --> 00:19:09.713
George!

00:19:10.194 --> 00:19:12.303
Candy, why do you know George?

00:19:12.703 --> 00:19:14.718
I was abducted by him!

00:19:16.437 --> 00:19:18.318
That's impossible!

00:19:18.722 --> 00:19:24.250
Aunt, it really is true that I ordered
Sam to kidnap Candy.

00:19:24.789 --> 00:19:26.601
Just why did you...

00:19:26.874 --> 00:19:30.117
I was instructed to do so
by grandfather William himself.

00:19:30.764 --> 00:19:32.202
By William?

00:19:32.336 --> 00:19:36.515
I'm here to deliver you this
letter from Mr. William.

00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:44.911
I hereby proclaim that Candice White,
a servant of the Leagan family,

00:19:44.946 --> 00:19:48.545
...is now my foster daughter.
-William A. Adley.

00:19:50.837 --> 00:19:53.819
I am... adopted by the Adley family?

00:19:54.805 --> 00:19:57.291
He really read my letter!

00:19:57.426 --> 00:19:59.980
What, you wrote him a letter as well?

00:20:00.402 --> 00:20:02.105
-Bro, you too?
-Yeah.

00:20:02.946 --> 00:20:04.266
Then, of course...

00:20:04.301 --> 00:20:08.607
Of course! I wrote it as well.
I'm sure I wrote it before you guys.

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:10.482
This guy...

00:20:11.129 --> 00:20:14.192
George! Take Candy away now!

00:20:14.745 --> 00:20:21.261
You and William are working together, how else
could he have made such a whimsical decision...

00:20:21.296 --> 00:20:26.113
I am responsible to mr. William alone,
especially concerning such important affairs.

00:20:27.935 --> 00:20:33.431
I understand. William's decisions
are final. There's nothing I can do.

00:20:34.171 --> 00:20:36.433
William's whims again...!

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:42.322
Aunt is so scary and cold.

00:20:42.914 --> 00:20:48.252
But if I can live with Anthony...
I can bear anything!

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:50.532
That's great, Candy.

00:20:50.773 --> 00:20:55.437
Miss Candice White Adley.
Sounds great!

00:20:58.537 --> 00:20:59.775
Thank you, everyone!

00:20:59.935 --> 00:21:04.988
Thanks to everybody, I am... I am...

00:21:06.204 --> 00:21:09.376
There were tears in Candy's eyes.

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:13.825
Yet those were warm tears, tears
which have already long forgotten...

00:21:13.826 --> 00:21:16.266
...everything bad that had happened
up until now.

00:21:16.301 --> 00:21:20.492
To be continued.
